---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main>
		<header class="site-header">
			<h1>Raksha's Pratyaksha</h1>

			<nav>
				<a href="/projects">Projects</a>
				<a href="/writing">Writing</a>
				<a href="/contact">Contact</a>
			</nav>
		</header>

		<section class="home-content">

			<!-- ARTWORK GRID -->

			<div class="artwork-grid">

				<!-- LEFT SIDE: TANJORE + THREE SMALL ARTWORKS -->

				<div class="left-artwork">

					<a
						class="artwork artwork-large"
						href="https://archive.org/details/indiaillustrated00urwi/page/58/mode/2up"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
					>
						<img
							src="/images/tanjore-brihadeshwara.jpg"
							alt="Brihadeshwara Temple in Tanjore"
						/>
					</a>

					<div class="bottom-artworks">

						<a
							class="artwork artwork-3"
							href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vaddadi_Papaiah"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							<img
								src="/images/vaddadi-papaiah.jpg"
								alt="Artwork by Vaddadi Papaiah"
							/>
						</a>

						<a
							class="artwork artwork-4"
							href="https://www.instagram.com/lera.dubitskaya"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							<img
								src="/images/lera-dubitskaya.jpg"
								alt="Artwork by Lera Dubitskaya"
							/>
						</a>

						<a
							class="artwork artwork-5"
							href="https://www.aaronmorse.com/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							<img
								src="/images/note-to-self.jpg"
								alt="Note to Self by Aaron Morse"
							/>
						</a>

					</div>

				</div>


				<!-- RIGHT SIDE: PATTERNS IN THE SKY + DREAMERS -->

				<div class="right-artwork">

					<a
						class="artwork artwork-2"
						href="https://artuk.org/discover/stories/patterns-in-the-sky-the-mysterious-landscapes-of-sidney-herbert-sime"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
					>
						<img
							src="/images/patterns-in-the-sky.jpg"
							alt="Patterns in the Sky by Sidney H. Sime"
						/>
					</a>

					<a
						class="artwork artwork-6"
						href="https://www.artflute.com/artworks/dreamers"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
					>
						<img
							src="/images/sakti-burman-dreamers.avif"
							alt="Dreamers by Sakti Burman"
						/>
					</a>

				</div>

			</div>


			<!-- INTRODUCTION -->

			<div class="introduction">

				<p>
					Hi!
					I’m Sriraksha (Raksha) and welcome to my corner of the internet!
				</p>

				<p>
					Pratyakṣa means knowing something through direct perception.
					I’m treating this as a nook to explore and expand upon mine.
				</p>

				<p>
					My interests lie in understanding the priors from which our current
					milieu of ideas and sense making apparatus has emerged, how culture
					and institutions get constituted, how this feeds into our visual
					perception and meaning making, and filtered into artificial
					intelligence and how we instrumentalize it. My interests are pretty
					wide ranging within art, technology, philosophy, and culture.
				</p>

				<p>
					This curiousity has loosesly guided the direction of my work.
					I started out in electrical engineering and gradually became
					fascinated by colour science, image quality and the strange
					business of making machines “see.” Today, I work with pixels and
					image sensors, tinkering with how cameras capture and represent
					the world.
				</p>

				<p>
					The artwork scattered across this page is a small experiment in
					perception, based on&nbsp;   
					<a
						href="https://www.gestaltprinciples.com/"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
					>
						 Gestalt Principles
					</a>.
					I am curious about the impression they can provide collectively,
					and how we can direct attention with that. I also play with a
					similarish idea in my photography, loosely borrowing from
					Impressionism and using Instagram as my medium.
				</p>

				<p>
					In my spare time, I love philosophizing, photography, writing,
					cinema, cooking, and can never say no to a meandering walk.
				</p>

			</div>

		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>


<style>
:global(body) {
	margin: 0;
	font-family: 'Philosopher', sans-serif;
	color: var(--text);
	background: var(--background);
	min-height: 100vh;
}


/* PAGE */

main {
	min-height: 100vh;
	padding: 24px 32px;
	box-sizing: border-box;
}


/* HEADER */

.site-header {
	display: flex;
	justify-content: space-between;
	align-items: center;
	margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.site-header h1 {
	font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 64px);
	font-weight: 400;
	margin: 0;
}

.site-header nav {
	display: flex;
	gap: 70px;
}

.site-header nav a {
	color: var(--text);
	text-decoration: none;
	font-size: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 42px);
}

.site-header nav a:hover {
	opacity: 0.5;
}


/* MAIN CONTENT */

.home-content {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: 2.1fr 1fr;
	gap: 18px;
	align-items: start;
}


/* ARTWORK AREA */

.artwork-grid {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: 2.4fr 1fr;
	gap: 10px;
	height: calc(100vh - 140px);
}


/* LEFT ARTWORK GROUP */

.left-artwork {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-rows: 2.3fr 1fr;
	gap: 20px;
	min-height: 0;
}


/* THREE SMALL ARTWORKS */

.bottom-artworks {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
	gap: 20px;
	min-height: 0;
}


/* RIGHT ARTWORK GROUP */

.right-artwork {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
	gap: 20px;
	min-height: 0;
}


/* INDIVIDUAL ARTWORK */

.artwork {
	display: block;
	overflow: hidden;
	background: var(--background);
	min-width: 0;
	min-height: 0;
}

.artwork img {
	width: 100%;
	height: 100%;
	display: block;
	object-fit: contain;
	transition: transform 0.3s ease, opacity 0.3s ease;
}

.artwork:hover img {
	transform: scale(1.02);
	opacity: 0.85;
}


/* INTRODUCTION */

.introduction {
	font-size: clamp(17px, 1.2vw, 27px);
	line-height: 1.25;
	padding: 4px 0;
	text-align: justify;
	text-justify: inter-word;
}

.introduction p {
	margin: 0 0 18px 0;
}

.introduction p:last-child {
	margin-bottom: 0;
}

.introduction a {
	color: var(--text);
	text-decoration: underline;
	text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
	text-underline-offset: 3px;
}

.introduction a:hover {
	opacity: 0.55;
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {

  /* HOMEPAGE */

  .home-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  /* ARTWORK GRID */

  .artwork-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: 160px 160px;
    gap: 10px;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .left-artwork,
  .right-artwork,
  .bottom-artworks {
    display: contents;
  }

  .artwork {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .artwork img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* ARTWORK ORDER */

  .artwork-large {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1;
  }

  .artwork-2 {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1;
  }

  .artwork-3 {
    grid-column: 3;
    grid-row: 1;
  }

  .artwork-4 {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 2;
  }

  .artwork-5 {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 2;
  }

  .artwork-6 {
    grid-column: 3;
    grid-row: 2;
    display: block;
  }

  /* INTRODUCTION */

  .introduction {
    order: 2;
    width: 100%;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* HEADER */

  .site-header {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .site-header h1 {
    font-size: 36px;
  }

  .site-header nav {
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .site-header nav a {
    font-size: 20px;
  }
}
</style>